  "question": {
    "text": "The displacement of a particle executing SHM is given by $x=10 \\sin \\left(w t+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) m$. The time period of motion is $3.14 \\mathrm{~s}$. The velocity of the particle at $t=0$ is ______$\\mathrm{m} / \\mathrm{s}$."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "10",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Given,\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{T}=3.14=\\frac{2 \\pi}{\\omega} \\\\\n& \\omega=2 \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{s} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{x}=10 \\sin \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) \\\\\n& \\mathrm{v}=\\frac{\\mathrm{dx}}{\\mathrm{dt}}=10 \\omega \\cos \\left(\\omega \\mathrm{t}+\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right) \\\\\n& \\text { at } \\mathrm{t}=0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{v}=10 \\omega \\cos \\left(\\frac{\\pi}{3}\\right)=10 \\times 2 \\times \\frac{1}{2}[\\mathrm{using} \\omega=2 \\mathrm{rad} / \\mathrm{s}] \\\\\n& \\mathrm{v}=10 \\mathrm{~m} / \\mathrm{s}\n\\end{aligned}$"
  }
}